#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: bloggermigrator.php
msgid "BloggerMigrator"
msgstr "BloggerMigrator"

#. Description of the plugin
#: bloggermigrator.php
msgid ""
"Migrasi Blogger ke WordPress dari Google Takeout secara offline. Konten, "
"gambar, komentar, dan redirect 301 dari backup, tanpa blog online."
msgstr ""
"Migrate a Blogger blog to WordPress offline from Google Takeout. Content, "
"images, comments, and 301 redirects from your backup, no online blog needed."

#. Author of the plugin
#: bloggermigrator.php
msgid "Sugeng.id"
msgstr "Sugeng.id"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: bloggermigrator.php
msgid "https://sugeng.id"
msgstr "https://sugeng.id"

#: class-bm-admin.php:72 includes/class-bm-admin.php:72
msgid "Request gagal. Periksa koneksi lalu coba lagi."
msgstr "Request failed. Check your connection and try again."

#: class-bm-admin.php:73 includes/class-bm-admin.php:73
msgid "Pilih file arsip Takeout dulu."
msgstr "Choose a Takeout archive file first."

#: class-bm-admin.php:74 includes/class-bm-admin.php:74
msgid "Arsip melebihi batas plugin."
msgstr "Archive exceeds the plugin limit."

#: class-bm-admin.php:75 includes/class-bm-admin.php:75
msgid ""
"Ukuran arsip melebihi batas upload PHP server. Upload hampir pasti gagal; "
"kecilkan file atau naikkan upload_max_filesize dan post_max_size."
msgstr ""
"Archive size exceeds the PHP server upload limit. The upload will almost "
"certainly fail; make the file smaller or raise upload_max_filesize and "
"post_max_size."

#: class-bm-admin.php:76 includes/class-bm-admin.php:76
msgid "Sumber Takeout belum dipilih, ulangi dari langkah 1."
msgstr "Takeout source not selected yet. Restart from step 1."

#: class-bm-admin.php:77 includes/class-bm-admin.php:77
msgid ""
"Mode ini mengubah struktur permalink situs. URL lama Blogger dialihkan "
"dengan redirect 301 otomatis. Mode bisa diganti nanti dengan menjalankan "
"ulang migrasi memakai mode lain. Lanjutkan?"
msgstr ""
"This mode changes the site's permalink structure. Old Blogger URLs are "
"redirected with automatic 301 redirects. You can switch modes later by re-"
"running the migration with another mode. Continue?"

#: class-bm-admin.php:78 includes/class-bm-admin.php:78
msgid "Job sebelumnya belum selesai. Mulai dari awal?"
msgstr "The previous job has not finished. Start over?"

#: class-bm-admin.php:79 includes/class-bm-admin.php:79
msgid ""
"State job akan dihapus dan wizard kembali ke awal. Konten hasil impor tidak "
"ikut terhapus. Lanjutkan?"
msgstr ""
"The job state will be cleared and the wizard returns to the start. Imported "
"content will not be deleted. Continue?"

